# The root R0 without an entry. The observation of line 60 of the row construction_paths, separated: the index is
# changed from 0 to 1 before the call, then the real code of C reads Leaf/B through the reference its parent
# declares (a path with the index) and writes the observable into `Log` explicitly: `Log\selected` 2; `Log\before`
# 1, `Log\after` 1. (With the index 0 the same body would read 1.)
@: Log (int: before 0; int: selected 0; int: after 0)
@: D (
    S(A(Leaf(int: v 1)); B(Leaf(int: v 2)))
    int: i 0
    C(
        @: saved S[i]\Leaf
        go:
            Log\selected := saved\v
        end: go
    )
)
Log\before := 1
D\i := 1
call(code := D\C\go)
Log\after := 1
